    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Same search as the Mahalla app\n\n1. Install the community node `n8n-nodes-serpapi`.\n2. Set `q` (business type), `ll` (`@lat,lng,zoom`), and `hl` (`en` or `ar`).\n3. Attach a SerpApi credential and a Google Sheets credential.\n4. Replace `YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID` and use a tab named Businesses.\n\nCity coordinates:\n- Tripoli `@32.8872,13.1913,13z`\n- Benghazi `@32.1167,20.0667,13z`\n- Cairo `@30.0444,31.2357,12z`\n- Tunis `@36.8065,10.1815,13z`\n- Amman `@31.9454,35.9284,13z`\n- Dubai `@25.2048,55.2708,12z`\n- Riyadh `@24.7136,46.6753,12z`",
